# Play test of Temperance Remade (CIPlay temperance_remade, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the
# village on the north flats (4 m), the road up to the station's terrace (9 m), Selene's station along its north edge
# (its entrance at the west end), the path up to the telescope's terrace (18 m), the sunken snowmobile in the bay.
island Temperance Remade
expect step 0
expect title The Reactor's Last Breath

# The village: the chief's note on the store crate, the store's own drum
walk 6 46 to 2 37 h=4
zone village
expect step 1
read Station chief's note
expect step 2
walk 2 37 to 4.5 38.4 h=4
reach Village store crate
open Village store crate
expect story cable 1
expect step 3

# The snowmobile under the ice in the bay north-west: its sled crate
at -34 48.6 h=-0.6
open Sled crate
expect story cable 2
expect step 4

# Up the road to the station's terrace, along it to the path up the peak: the survey crate by the telescope
walk -2 31 to -6.8 29 to -11.6 27 to -14 26 to -8 23.5 to 2 23.5 to 7 23 to 8 12 h=9
walk 8 12 to 3.7 6.7 to -0.7 1.3 to -4 -3 to -3.4 -3.9 h=18
reach Survey crate
open Survey crate
expect story cable 3
# (all three drums carried; the road passed the station's door on the way up: its step is done already)
expect step 7

# Back down to the station: in through its entrance hall; the inner doors shut while the reactor is dead
walk -3.4 -3.9 to -0.7 1.3 to 3.7 6.7 to 8 12 h=9.6
walk 8 12 to 7 23 to 2 23.5 to -12 23.5 to -17 23.5 to -17 19 h=9
zone station
expect step 7
walk -16 18 to -11 18 h=9 below=12
walk -10.5 18 to -6 18 blocked h=9 below=12
use reactor
expect message slide apart
expect story cable 0
wait 2
walk -10.5 18 to -5 18 h=9 below=12
zone inner
expect step 8
kill Polar bear
expect step 9
walk -5 18 to 0 17.5 to 1.8 16.2 h=9 below=12
reach Chief's vault
open Chief's vault
wait 4
expect item Blueprint_SmelterElectric 1
expect item Blueprint_AnchorStationaryAdvanced 1
expect done
